 amics Days Asia-Pacific 2024 - Conference
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Dynamics Days Asia-Pacific\nWebsite: https://
 www2.yukawa.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~frontier24/DDAP13/\nSource URL: https://www2.y
 ukawa.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~frontier24/DDAP13/\nLocation: Kyoto\, Japan\nTopics:
  Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos\, Complex Systems & Network Science\nSize: M\
 nSubmission type: Talks/abstracts\; next call unannounced\nConfidence: co
 nfirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: Latest officially verified
  edition is DDAP13/YKIS 2024\, part of a longer institute workshop. As of
  2026-10-28 neither the DDAP13 page nor the Dynamics Days directory annou
 nces DDAP14 or any 2026/2027 meeting\; the historical biennial timing is 
 not projected. No full-paper proceedings promise is asserted. Size is an 
 editorial estimate.\nScope: Nonlinear dynamics and nonequilibrium complex
  systems\, including chaos\, collective behavior\, statistical physics an
 d dynamics of learning. The latest verified meeting was linked to a broad
 er Yukawa Institute workshop\; its invited-talk format should not be mist
 aken for a verified open full-paper call.\nAdditional topics: Machine Lea
 rning\nScope sources (2024): https://www2.yukawa.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~frontier2
 4/DDAP13/\, https://dynamicsdays.info/ap/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-08
URL:https://www2.yukawa.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~frontier24/DDAP13/
LOCATION:Kyoto\, Japan
END:VEVENT
