 , and human-centered multimedia experiences. The 2026 steering-committee 
 scope also emphasizes explainability. Healthcare\, education\, and entert
 ainment are applications\, not blanket topical identities.\nAdditional to
 pics: Machine Learning\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, Human-AI In
 teraction & Deployment\, Data Mining & Data Science\, Explainability & In
 terpretability\nScope sources (2026): https://2026.acmmm.org/site/topics.
 html\, https://2026.acmmm.org/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://www.acmmm.org/
LOCATION:Hong Kong\, China
END:VEVENT
